WEBVTT

01:41.509 --> 01:45.930
[Love of the Divine Tree]

01:46.620 --> 01:48.950
[Episode 26]

01:49.680 --> 01:50.640
Then I wouldn't have pushed you

01:50.640 --> 01:52.070
to Su Yishui.

01:55.200 --> 01:56.509
But in the end,

01:58.590 --> 01:59.789
what did I get?

02:02.280 --> 02:03.560
What I got was the poison

02:03.560 --> 02:05.230
secretly sent by my second brother.

02:07.200 --> 02:08.430
What I got was

02:09.750 --> 02:12.000
this body that is forever in pain,

02:13.400 --> 02:15.000
a gift from him in his fight

02:15.000 --> 02:16.910
to become the Crown Prince.

02:24.630 --> 02:26.000
The poison in your body

02:26.280 --> 02:27.630
was your brother's doing?

02:29.400 --> 02:30.910
I was too naive back then.

02:32.930 --> 02:34.560
I've realized that in an imperial family,

02:35.960 --> 02:37.190
nothing else matters,

02:39.520 --> 02:42.240
except for the throne.

02:44.079 --> 02:46.120
Unfortunately, I realized it too late.

02:47.590 --> 02:48.520
Killing that

02:48.520 --> 02:50.030
ingrate

02:52.010 --> 02:53.010
couldn't change the fact

02:53.030 --> 02:54.780
that the poison had spread through my organs.

02:56.030 --> 02:57.430
As a result,

02:59.750 --> 03:00.800
I have no choice

03:00.800 --> 03:02.030
but to find another body.

03:14.430 --> 03:16.230
I'm forced into this.

03:17.150 --> 03:19.190
I truly regret my choice back then.

03:21.190 --> 03:22.190
But now that

03:22.190 --> 03:23.960
I have a chance to survive,

03:24.680 --> 03:25.630
there's no way

03:26.960 --> 03:28.120
I'll settle for

03:28.120 --> 03:29.310
the current situation.

03:29.960 --> 03:31.840
No matter what the cost,

03:32.870 --> 03:34.660
I must change everything.

03:35.870 --> 03:37.150
Let's find another way together,

03:37.150 --> 03:37.710
okay?

03:38.430 --> 03:40.000
I'm quite skilled in alchemy,

03:40.310 --> 03:41.000
and in the universe,

03:41.000 --> 03:42.630
there are many people with special skills.

03:44.430 --> 03:45.190
But Ranran,

03:47.430 --> 03:48.560
what I want

03:49.840 --> 03:51.590
has never been any elixir

03:53.630 --> 03:55.160
or some extra years

03:55.190 --> 03:56.400
of struggling to survive.

03:57.190 --> 03:59.000
What I want is immortality!

04:00.380 --> 04:01.490
I will stop you.

04:01.520 --> 04:02.190
Why?

04:08.800 --> 04:10.030
Back then, you said the Heavenly Ones

04:10.030 --> 04:11.190
did not interfere in court affairs,

04:11.470 --> 04:12.150
but you still

04:12.150 --> 04:13.710
put all that aside to help me.

04:14.960 --> 04:16.070
Why can't you…

04:19.040 --> 04:20.120
do that again this time?

04:23.070 --> 04:25.120
I don't need you to step in.

04:26.380 --> 04:28.550
I just want you to stand by my side.

04:30.040 --> 04:31.040
That's enough.

04:43.800 --> 04:45.000
Why did you bring me here?

05:14.870 --> 05:17.390
I've set up a formation in the Eastern Palace,

05:18.630 --> 05:20.630
especially over this Inquiry Pond.

05:21.430 --> 05:23.270
Whether you're willing to help me or not,

05:23.680 --> 05:25.040
no one can stop me

05:25.800 --> 05:27.270
from doing what I'm going to do.

05:28.040 --> 05:28.720
Not even

05:28.720 --> 05:30.560
Su Yishui, who prides himself

05:31.190 --> 05:32.270
on his powerful magic.

05:33.950 --> 05:35.390
That's why you sealed off the Inquiry Pond?

05:37.600 --> 05:39.430
Su Yishui came to me himself.

05:40.159 --> 05:41.680
I was truly delighted.

05:42.630 --> 05:43.390
Originally, Feng

05:43.390 --> 05:44.950
planned to use the Four-Way Waterways

05:45.270 --> 05:47.120
to gather spiritual energy

05:47.680 --> 05:50.070
and refine the Green Dragon to extend my life.

05:50.830 --> 05:52.560
But the earthquake caused the waterways to collapse,

05:52.830 --> 05:53.870
which led me to discover

05:53.870 --> 05:54.870
that those waterways

05:55.120 --> 05:56.390
were filled with malicious energy.

05:57.360 --> 05:58.190
Compared to spiritual energy,

05:58.190 --> 06:00.000
it can refine the Green Dragon much faster.

06:01.630 --> 06:03.000
As luck would have it,

06:03.920 --> 06:05.510
I met you in Puxin Village.

06:06.270 --> 06:07.070
That's when I learned

06:07.070 --> 06:08.720
that the malicious energy in those waterways

06:09.160 --> 06:10.680
all came from the Spirit Spring.

06:11.950 --> 06:12.870
The Spirit Spring…

06:13.750 --> 06:14.680
The Spirit Spring?

06:24.190 --> 06:25.430
He just passed out.

06:25.680 --> 06:26.360
The matter of the Spirit Spring

06:26.380 --> 06:27.380
must not be known by more people.

06:30.200 --> 06:31.640
So you were pretending.

06:32.310 --> 06:33.630
I really underestimated you.

06:34.870 --> 06:36.120
Otherwise,

06:37.000 --> 06:38.040
how could I have heard

06:38.040 --> 06:39.560
your conversation with Meng Zhang?

06:40.430 --> 06:41.600
It confirmed for me that

06:41.630 --> 06:43.800
the Seven Evil Transformation Spell truly works.

06:44.480 --> 06:45.310
Not only can it

06:45.310 --> 06:47.159
merge two bodies into one,

06:47.720 --> 06:49.159
but it can also guide a soul

06:49.920 --> 06:52.510
to permanently reside in someone else's body.

06:53.950 --> 06:55.360
So from that moment on,

06:56.040 --> 06:56.800
you were set

06:56.800 --> 06:58.240
on your body-swapping plan.

07:01.390 --> 07:02.270
But I never expected

07:02.270 --> 07:04.240
the malicious energy to grow stronger,

07:04.390 --> 07:06.600
making the Green Dragon in the pond aggressive.

07:07.510 --> 07:08.680
I didn't want it

07:08.680 --> 07:10.560
to harm the people in the city,

07:11.600 --> 07:12.800
so I used a large number of

07:12.830 --> 07:14.390
cultivators' Golden Cores to suppress it.

07:16.830 --> 07:18.070
Because of that,

07:18.930 --> 07:19.570
I started

07:19.600 --> 07:21.310
having doubts about integrating

07:21.330 --> 07:22.450
with the Green Dragon.

07:23.000 --> 07:24.360
After all, dragons are hard to tame.

07:24.750 --> 07:26.600
If I failed to overpower the dragon's spirit

07:26.950 --> 07:28.000
and was consumed by its nature,

07:28.390 --> 07:29.630
I'd be in trouble.

07:30.830 --> 07:32.150
But just at that moment,

07:33.040 --> 07:34.190
I learned that Su Yishui,

07:34.190 --> 07:35.360
at the Marrow-Cleansing Pool,

07:35.950 --> 07:37.240
used the Soul Control Technique

07:37.950 --> 07:39.240
to possess the White Tiger.

07:39.750 --> 07:40.360
You...

07:43.070 --> 07:44.600
I also happened to know

07:44.870 --> 07:46.310
that he once made a soul oath

07:47.120 --> 07:48.000
to help Meng Zhang

07:48.000 --> 07:49.480
find the lost dragon egg

07:49.950 --> 07:51.430
and return it to Dragon Island.

07:52.159 --> 07:52.920
So I knew

07:52.920 --> 07:54.830
Su Yishui would definitely come to save the Green Dragon

07:55.390 --> 07:56.510
and use his Soul Control Technique

07:56.510 --> 07:57.510
to possess the Green Dragon.

07:58.120 --> 07:58.600
That way,

07:59.270 --> 08:01.390
he'd leave his body behind.

08:01.560 --> 08:03.000
His body would be empty,

08:03.510 --> 08:04.800
but it's powerful enough

08:04.800 --> 08:06.070
to withstand a body snatching.

08:06.630 --> 08:07.430
Tell me,

08:08.160 --> 08:09.800
isn't this a heaven-sent opportunity?

08:13.750 --> 08:14.800
After all, in this world,

08:15.240 --> 08:17.070
Su Yishui is the best option

08:17.750 --> 08:19.720
for my body-snatching plan.

08:20.870 --> 08:22.560
He's my cousin, after all.

08:22.830 --> 08:23.920
Since childhood,

08:24.190 --> 08:25.820
we've looked somewhat similar.

08:26.410 --> 08:27.760
Switching bodies with him

08:28.680 --> 08:30.210
will make it easier to explain

08:30.240 --> 08:31.680
appearance changes in the future.

08:36.159 --> 08:36.880
And as a bonus,

08:36.909 --> 08:38.120
I'll gain all his spiritual power.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.000
Despicable!

08:39.360 --> 08:40.200
Now, everything

08:40.200 --> 08:41.630
is under my control.

08:42.240 --> 08:43.510
Whatever I want,

08:43.960 --> 08:45.270
I will have!

08:51.790 --> 08:52.630
Ranran.

08:55.180 --> 08:57.030
The 7th of this month is an auspicious day.

08:59.240 --> 08:59.960
Once I

08:59.960 --> 09:01.870
take over Su Yishui's body,

09:02.600 --> 09:03.790
I'll come to marry you,

09:04.200 --> 09:04.840
okay?

09:06.960 --> 09:07.720
By then,

09:09.240 --> 09:09.960
you can stay

09:09.960 --> 09:11.080
by my side with the affection

09:11.790 --> 09:12.600
for both of us.

09:14.480 --> 09:15.790
Su Yu, are you insane?

09:16.320 --> 09:17.750
I will never marry you!

09:18.440 --> 09:20.370
After you become my Crown Princess,

09:22.000 --> 09:23.270
I'll do everything you wish.

09:24.960 --> 09:26.120
But now,

09:26.480 --> 09:28.200
you have no say in this.

09:29.150 --> 09:29.910
Guards!

09:32.470 --> 09:33.200
Yes!

09:34.080 --> 09:35.360
Escort Miss Ranran

09:36.360 --> 09:37.630
to the Cool Breeze Palace.

09:38.600 --> 09:41.270
She'll stay there until she agrees to marry me!

09:41.720 --> 09:42.360
Yes!

09:44.960 --> 09:47.890
[Cool Breeze Palace, Eastern Palace]

09:52.670 --> 09:54.480
Master needs to suppress the Green Dragon's malicious energy.

09:54.910 --> 09:55.720
Only on the Double Ninth Festival

09:55.720 --> 09:57.080
can he lead it out of the Inquiry Pond,

09:57.720 --> 09:58.510
ensuring it won't

09:58.510 --> 09:59.720
endanger the entire capital.

10:01.460 --> 10:02.570
But before that, Su Yu

10:02.600 --> 10:03.360
plans to seize his body.

10:04.120 --> 10:05.480
Today is already the 4th.

10:06.080 --> 10:07.150
Master still doesn't know

10:07.150 --> 10:08.510
about Su Yu's plan.

10:10.000 --> 10:10.840
I must find a way

10:10.840 --> 10:11.790
to get out of here

10:12.510 --> 10:13.440
and stop all of this.

10:22.630 --> 10:24.150
If you want to go out for a walk,

10:25.080 --> 10:26.670
just send someone to let me know.

10:28.840 --> 10:29.630
No matter how busy I am,

10:30.670 --> 10:31.510
I'll always have time for you.

10:34.510 --> 10:35.360
Ranran, look,

10:36.400 --> 10:38.070
this is the wedding dress I prepared for you.

10:47.120 --> 10:48.000
And this pearl—

10:49.390 --> 10:51.030
do you still remember it?

10:53.150 --> 10:55.000
Back then, when I was falsely accused in court,

10:55.190 --> 10:56.500
I was depressed for days.

10:57.150 --> 10:58.480
To cheer me up,

10:59.150 --> 11:01.030
you took me to the seaside to collect pearl oysters,

11:01.360 --> 11:02.630
and we found this one.

11:03.200 --> 11:05.030
At the time, you joked

11:05.550 --> 11:07.390
that since I found this pearl myself,

11:07.750 --> 11:09.790
it was the only one in the vast ocean,

11:10.910 --> 11:12.080
and one day,

11:12.480 --> 11:13.870
I should give it to my bride.

11:18.150 --> 11:19.720
I've always remembered your words.

11:23.600 --> 11:24.750
But you don't know

11:26.150 --> 11:27.360
that since that day,

11:28.440 --> 11:30.200
the one I want to give this pearl to

11:31.080 --> 11:32.110
has always been you.

11:32.470 --> 11:33.240
I don't remember

11:33.240 --> 11:34.240
any of that.

11:34.840 --> 11:35.750
And this pearl

11:35.960 --> 11:36.870
doesn't suit me.

11:43.960 --> 11:44.630
It's alright.

11:46.750 --> 11:48.360
All those memories from the past—

11:49.320 --> 11:50.240
once we're married,

11:50.240 --> 11:51.550
I'll have plenty of time

11:52.720 --> 11:53.910
to tell you about them.

11:54.670 --> 11:55.510
Su Yu,

11:56.240 --> 11:57.550
did you even listen

11:57.570 --> 11:58.240
to what I said?

11:59.320 --> 12:00.240
Let me go.

12:00.600 --> 12:01.840
Don't harm my master,

12:01.870 --> 12:02.750
and don't hurt those

12:02.750 --> 12:03.510
innocent people.

12:03.870 --> 12:04.840
Maybe then, in the future,

12:04.840 --> 12:05.840
we could still be friends.

12:06.480 --> 12:07.320
I'll definitely find a way…

12:07.320 --> 12:07.840
You should know

12:07.840 --> 12:08.600
that I never wanted

12:08.600 --> 12:09.510
to just be your friend!

12:20.840 --> 12:21.510
Alright.

12:23.790 --> 12:25.440
No more talking.

12:28.360 --> 12:29.720
Since last night,

12:30.240 --> 12:31.390
you haven't eaten anything, have you?

12:38.240 --> 12:38.790
Sit down.

12:39.630 --> 12:40.670
Eat with me.

12:41.800 --> 12:43.750
I need to eat to have the strength to escape.

13:07.320 --> 13:09.080
Since you passed away over a decade ago,

13:10.030 --> 13:10.910
no one has

13:10.910 --> 13:12.480
shared a meal with me like this.

13:21.720 --> 13:23.270
This braised lamb

13:24.360 --> 13:25.720
and these taro ribs—

13:26.810 --> 13:27.570
I made them myself

13:27.600 --> 13:28.390
this morning.

13:29.200 --> 13:30.000
They were both

13:30.240 --> 13:31.390
your favorite dishes.

13:32.360 --> 13:34.080
You taught me how to make them.

13:36.960 --> 13:38.630
Over the years, whenever I felt lonely

13:39.930 --> 13:41.050
or missed you,

13:41.080 --> 13:42.320
I'd cook these dishes.

13:43.200 --> 13:44.150
Come on, eat up.

13:46.120 --> 13:48.150
Try these taro ribs.

13:51.270 --> 13:53.000
Do they taste like the ones you used to make?

13:59.080 --> 13:59.790
I don't like

14:00.270 --> 14:01.630
these dishes anymore.

14:17.050 --> 14:17.810
Go bring

14:17.840 --> 14:19.120
the chef in the kitchen today here.

14:28.720 --> 14:30.390
Greetings, Your Highness.

14:31.080 --> 14:32.150
The Crown Princess

14:32.870 --> 14:34.150
loves the dishes you made.

14:35.870 --> 14:37.320
Thank you for your praise, Your Highness.

14:37.670 --> 14:38.960
The food I made

14:39.030 --> 14:39.910
being liked…

14:40.440 --> 14:42.200
being liked by the Crown Princess

14:42.360 --> 14:44.200
is my greatest honor.

14:44.750 --> 14:45.320
Indeed.

14:46.750 --> 14:47.790
She likes them so much

14:47.790 --> 14:49.120
that she completely ignored

14:49.140 --> 14:50.260
the dishes I personally made.

14:52.550 --> 14:53.550
How do you think

14:54.200 --> 14:55.720
I should reward you?

14:55.960 --> 14:57.000
My apologies.

14:57.390 --> 14:58.360
Please forgive me, Your Highness.

14:58.440 --> 14:59.510
Please forgive me, Your Highness!

14:59.910 --> 15:00.630
Guards!

15:04.720 --> 15:05.550
Take him away.

15:07.600 --> 15:08.480
Beat him to death!

15:09.090 --> 15:09.550
Yes!

15:09.550 --> 15:10.390
Spare me, Your Highness!

15:10.480 --> 15:11.440
Have mercy, Your Highness!

15:11.510 --> 15:12.240
Stop!

15:12.660 --> 15:13.630
Su Yu, are you crazy?

15:15.960 --> 15:16.720
From now on,

15:16.750 --> 15:18.550
you can only like the food I make for you.

15:18.860 --> 15:20.290
You can only like the things I give you.

15:20.320 --> 15:21.360
You can only like me!

15:23.480 --> 15:24.200
If you

15:24.200 --> 15:26.000
still long for anything else,

15:27.360 --> 15:29.000
then I'll make it all…

15:30.270 --> 15:31.200
disappear.

15:33.120 --> 15:33.790
Take him away!

15:35.200 --> 15:36.030
I'll eat now!

15:38.000 --> 15:38.720
Let him go.

15:43.910 --> 15:44.910
That's more like it.

15:51.810 --> 15:53.780
T-Thank you for your mercy, Your Highness.

15:53.840 --> 15:55.320
Thank you for your mercy.

15:56.360 --> 15:56.870
You may leave.

15:57.390 --> 15:57.910
Yes, yes.

16:08.030 --> 16:08.630
Sit.

16:15.480 --> 16:16.200
Sit!

16:25.600 --> 16:26.870
If you like anything,

16:27.440 --> 16:28.480
just tell me.

16:29.030 --> 16:30.320
I'll get it for you.

16:31.480 --> 16:32.150
Oh, right.

16:33.270 --> 16:34.240
I told you before

16:34.240 --> 16:35.480
that I'd take you to see the red leaves

16:35.670 --> 16:36.320
and to try

16:36.320 --> 16:37.360
the best Eight-Treasure Duck in the capital.

16:37.510 --> 16:38.320
I haven't forgotten.

16:39.670 --> 16:40.840
I'll do them with you

16:41.600 --> 16:42.320
to make up for

16:42.320 --> 16:43.600
the regrets of the past 18 years.

16:53.870 --> 16:54.910
Do you have any medicine on you?

16:59.360 --> 17:00.750
So you still care about me.

17:01.960 --> 17:02.720
You're worried about me,

17:03.840 --> 17:04.349
aren't you?

17:05.440 --> 17:06.310
I care about you

17:07.109 --> 17:08.480
because I still remember

17:09.180 --> 17:10.130
the Young Master Yu who once

17:10.160 --> 17:11.640
helped me at the foot of Mount Absolute.

17:12.440 --> 17:14.200
I know this isn't who you truly are.

17:14.920 --> 17:16.349
Please, be the person you used to be.

17:21.920 --> 17:23.000
The person I used to be?

17:24.589 --> 17:25.400
I've long become

17:25.400 --> 17:26.680
who I am now.

17:30.200 --> 17:31.790
If I were to turn back now,

17:33.590 --> 17:35.720
I'd surely die without a resting place.

17:39.680 --> 17:40.720
So now,

17:40.720 --> 17:42.440
I have no choice but to walk down this path

17:43.400 --> 17:44.240
until I

17:44.240 --> 17:45.880
reach the very top!

17:50.770 --> 17:53.040
[Outside the Imperial City]

18:03.000 --> 18:04.240
The imperial palace is heavily guarded.

18:04.400 --> 18:05.110
The barrier surrounding it

18:05.110 --> 18:05.830
is impenetrable.

18:05.880 --> 18:07.200
Even sound transmission talismans can't get through.

18:08.270 --> 18:09.550
I wonder how Ranran and Master

18:09.550 --> 18:10.720
are doing.

18:14.880 --> 18:16.230
More gifts again.

18:17.880 --> 18:18.550
Gold,

18:19.310 --> 18:19.880
wood,

18:20.960 --> 18:21.480
water,

18:23.000 --> 18:23.590
fire,

18:24.510 --> 18:25.110
and earth.

18:26.680 --> 18:27.350
Got it!

18:27.940 --> 18:28.980
With all five elements,

18:29.070 --> 18:30.070
I can use them to strengthen

18:30.070 --> 18:31.550
the power of my talismans.

18:32.640 --> 18:34.310
I remember part of the Soul Control Technique

18:34.590 --> 18:35.830
Master used.

18:36.400 --> 18:37.590
If I modify the puppet talisman

18:37.640 --> 18:39.440
based on the Soul Control Technique,

18:39.960 --> 18:40.720
it should work.

19:01.440 --> 19:02.310
It worked!

19:04.150 --> 19:05.390
Hey, I'm so hungry.

19:05.510 --> 19:06.550
I'm starving.

19:06.680 --> 19:08.110
Bring me some food!

19:11.960 --> 19:12.510
Miss,

19:12.790 --> 19:13.400
your food is here.

20:03.750 --> 20:05.000
It's only a 30-minute walk,

20:05.270 --> 20:06.680
but it actually took me so long.

20:07.550 --> 20:08.200
If I had known,

20:08.200 --> 20:09.310
I'd have made the wooden puppet's legs

20:09.400 --> 20:10.200
a bit longer.

20:25.030 --> 20:25.880
Xue Ranran.

20:26.400 --> 20:27.030
Master,

20:27.480 --> 20:28.310
you figured out so quickly

20:28.310 --> 20:29.240
that the wooden puppet was me.

20:32.680 --> 20:33.880
Who taught you the Soul Control Technique?

20:34.240 --> 20:35.680
Separating the spiritual soul from the body consumes immense energy.

20:36.030 --> 20:37.550
A single mistake, and it could backfire,

20:37.750 --> 20:38.680
leaving you severely injured.

20:38.960 --> 20:40.110
You're so reckless.

20:40.550 --> 20:42.200
If it's so harmful to the body,

20:42.440 --> 20:43.270
then what about you?

20:43.590 --> 20:45.350
You haven't fully recovered from your last injury,

20:45.590 --> 20:46.720
yet you still used the Soul Control Technique

20:46.750 --> 20:48.070
to possess the Green Dragon.

20:48.310 --> 20:49.550
Does your safety not matter?

20:49.920 --> 20:50.720
It's different.

20:50.830 --> 20:51.750
I'm your master.

20:52.270 --> 20:53.110
You're not allowed to do

20:53.110 --> 20:54.000
something so dangerous again.

20:54.110 --> 20:54.720
Understood?

20:55.000 --> 20:56.550
Who's the master is still up for debate.

20:58.550 --> 20:59.200
Shui,

20:59.550 --> 21:00.310
promise me

21:01.020 --> 21:02.500
you won't take risks alone

21:02.830 --> 21:04.150
or use this dangerous technique again.

21:04.350 --> 21:05.070
Got it?

21:05.510 --> 21:06.030
Alright.

21:06.720 --> 21:08.070
I have something important to tell you.

21:09.420 --> 21:10.140
It's all my fault

21:10.750 --> 21:11.350
that Su Yu

21:11.350 --> 21:12.750
took your body.

21:14.070 --> 21:15.030
What he wants now

21:15.030 --> 21:16.230
is not the Green Dragon's body,

21:16.750 --> 21:18.270
but yours.

21:26.280 --> 21:27.690
I knew Su Yu lured me to the capital

21:27.720 --> 21:28.510
with some ulterior motive,

21:29.400 --> 21:30.310
but I never expected this

21:30.380 --> 21:31.440
to be his true goal.

21:33.590 --> 21:35.240
Clever plan.

21:35.480 --> 21:36.790
Do you have any way

21:36.960 --> 21:37.880
to get out of here

21:38.110 --> 21:39.440
and return to your body?

21:40.200 --> 21:41.680
Su Yu and his men can't get to the bottom of the pond,

21:42.160 --> 21:43.680
so they placed a strong spell seal

21:43.830 --> 21:44.960
on the pond and the Green Dragon.

21:45.400 --> 21:46.030
My spiritual power

21:46.030 --> 21:46.960
is greatly suppressed now.

21:47.310 --> 21:48.680
Unless I ride the dragon out of the Inquiry Pond,

21:48.920 --> 21:49.640
my primordial spirit

21:49.640 --> 21:51.110
will remain trapped by its side,

21:51.350 --> 21:52.070
unable to escape.

21:52.200 --> 21:53.510
Then what should we do?

21:54.200 --> 21:55.750
Su Yu is planning to seize your body on the 7th.

21:55.960 --> 21:57.920
We can't wait until the 9th.

21:59.310 --> 22:00.070
If that's the case,

22:00.400 --> 22:01.400
I have to forcefully control the dragon

22:01.400 --> 22:02.310
and break out ahead of time.

22:02.750 --> 22:03.270
No!

22:04.000 --> 22:05.310
If you leave the Inquiry Pond without accumulating

22:05.310 --> 22:06.070
enough spiritual power,

22:06.400 --> 22:08.350
your spiritual soul in the Green Dragon

22:08.510 --> 22:09.920
will suffer a backlash from its malicious energy.

22:10.640 --> 22:11.590
You're still injured.

22:11.640 --> 22:12.510
We can't take that risk.

22:13.200 --> 22:14.110
Let me find a way

22:14.160 --> 22:15.400
to stall him for another two days.

22:15.920 --> 22:16.720
What's your plan?

22:18.790 --> 22:20.510
I actually have the perfect excuse.

22:22.020 --> 22:24.260
Since Su Yu wants me to marry him,

22:24.590 --> 22:26.000
then I'll agree.

22:26.640 --> 22:28.160
But the wedding date

22:28.400 --> 22:29.270
needs to be decided by me.

22:29.880 --> 22:30.590
What?

22:30.720 --> 22:32.200
This way, we can not only buy more time

22:32.410 --> 22:33.410
but also make the guards

22:33.440 --> 22:34.350
lower their guard.

22:34.830 --> 22:35.830
That will give me a chance

22:35.920 --> 22:36.510
to sneak out and find

22:36.510 --> 22:37.680
the core of the formation in the Eastern Palace.

22:37.960 --> 22:38.510
Otherwise,

22:38.680 --> 22:40.350
even if you break out of the Inquiry Pond,

22:40.790 --> 22:41.790
the barrier around the Eastern Palace

22:41.830 --> 22:43.030
will still be a problem.

22:43.510 --> 22:45.110
Su Yu took advantage of the situation

22:45.240 --> 22:46.030
to force you into marriage,

22:46.400 --> 22:47.550
and you actually agreed?

22:47.960 --> 22:49.400
It's just a temporary measure.

22:49.830 --> 22:50.550
Still not acceptable!

22:51.030 --> 22:51.960
Stay out of it.

22:52.270 --> 22:53.640
I'll find a way to reclaim my body

22:53.720 --> 22:54.750
and break the formation myself.

22:55.070 --> 22:56.400
You absolutely cannot marry Su Yu.

22:56.680 --> 22:57.440
I'll say it again—

22:57.790 --> 22:59.480
you absolutely cannot marry Su Yu!

23:00.000 --> 23:01.720
But Master, you're trapped here.

23:02.000 --> 23:03.510
How can you break the formation?

23:07.200 --> 23:07.880
Master,

23:08.510 --> 23:10.310
you're so angry.

23:10.640 --> 23:12.070
Are you jealous?

23:12.590 --> 23:13.510
Xue Ranran,

23:14.080 --> 23:14.890
do you want to be punished

23:14.920 --> 23:15.720
in Westerly Valley?

23:16.070 --> 23:16.880
This is an order from your master.

23:16.960 --> 23:17.890
If you dare...

23:18.920 --> 23:20.550
Looks like I guessed right.

23:21.030 --> 23:21.590
Shui,

23:22.070 --> 23:23.270
you've got some nerve.

23:23.790 --> 23:25.510
Not only did you dare to be your master's master,

23:25.960 --> 23:27.640
but you also have your heart set on her.

23:29.270 --> 23:30.400
What a rebellious disciple.

23:30.680 --> 23:31.640
Xue Ranran!

23:32.590 --> 23:33.310
Don't worry.

23:33.590 --> 23:35.200
I won't actually marry Su Yu.

23:35.640 --> 23:36.310
But…

23:36.790 --> 23:37.440
since you're already

23:37.460 --> 23:39.050
so rebellious,

23:39.480 --> 23:40.310
why don't you

23:40.730 --> 23:42.070
marry me on that day?

23:44.960 --> 23:46.110
Stop talking nonsense.

23:48.030 --> 23:48.830
Alright.

23:49.750 --> 23:50.590
We'll

23:50.790 --> 23:51.790
discuss that later.

23:52.750 --> 23:53.960
Back to the main issue.

23:54.790 --> 23:56.270
I can see that much of the Green Dragon's

23:56.290 --> 23:57.690
malicious energy has been purified.

23:58.480 --> 24:00.110
What about "The Xuantian Teachings"?

24:07.960 --> 24:09.640
This is "The Xuantian Teachings."

24:10.200 --> 24:11.000
I've already read it.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.800
Aside from records about

24:12.830 --> 24:13.790
the founding of Celestial Sect,

24:14.240 --> 24:15.480
it only contains mortal techniques

24:15.510 --> 24:16.680
like the Seven Evil Transformation Spell.

24:17.240 --> 24:18.920
There's no mention of the netherworld.

24:20.350 --> 24:22.720
Nor any method for returning the spiritual soul.

24:23.920 --> 24:24.880
But if this scroll

24:24.960 --> 24:26.350
is capable of suppressing the Green Dragon,

24:26.750 --> 24:28.790
it can't be fake.

24:29.480 --> 24:30.400
Could it be

24:30.510 --> 24:32.150
that there's some secret to opening it?

24:32.550 --> 24:33.750
I've tried various methods,

24:34.640 --> 24:35.640
but nothing has changed.

24:37.440 --> 24:38.550
Unless there's another explanation:

24:40.830 --> 24:42.680
"The Xuantian Teachings" has another half.

24:45.070 --> 24:46.070
Now that I think about it,

24:46.880 --> 24:48.550
the empty box I found back then

24:48.830 --> 24:50.030
did seem large enough

24:50.030 --> 24:51.070
to hold two scrolls.

24:51.510 --> 24:52.830
So what you're saying is,

24:54.030 --> 24:54.920
only when both halves

24:55.310 --> 24:56.270
are combined

24:56.750 --> 24:57.720
will the true

24:57.720 --> 24:59.070
Xuantian Teachings be revealed?

24:59.590 --> 25:00.200
Exactly.

25:00.750 --> 25:02.400
Since no one has ever mentioned

25:02.480 --> 25:04.030
that "The Xuantian Teachings" has two volumes,

25:04.350 --> 25:05.720
the other half must be disguised

25:06.200 --> 25:07.640
in some way.

25:07.790 --> 25:09.160
Su Yu probably hasn't realized this either,

25:09.790 --> 25:10.480
so he mixed it in

25:10.510 --> 25:11.640
with your past life's old books

25:11.660 --> 25:12.860
and stored it in the study.

25:14.550 --> 25:15.270
But

25:15.880 --> 25:17.400
since there are two volumes,

25:17.680 --> 25:19.240
they must share something in common.

25:19.590 --> 25:20.200
Master,

25:20.480 --> 25:21.480
think back.

25:21.880 --> 25:23.400
When you found that empty box,

25:23.640 --> 25:24.310
was there

25:24.350 --> 25:25.790
anything special nearby?

25:33.270 --> 25:34.350
The material of the scroll.

25:35.160 --> 25:36.070
At that time, I came across a scroll

25:36.070 --> 25:36.790
called "The Path of Immortality."

25:37.200 --> 25:38.000
Its material

25:38.220 --> 25:39.130
is the same

25:39.160 --> 25:39.830
as this scroll.

25:40.350 --> 25:41.160
It looks like

25:41.400 --> 25:42.750
ordinary brocade,

25:43.530 --> 25:44.320
but it actually

25:44.350 --> 25:45.350
contains the rare

25:45.350 --> 25:46.510
Red-Tailed Fire Mouse Fur.

25:46.720 --> 25:47.590
It's fireproof.

25:48.590 --> 25:49.920
Red-Tailed Fire Mouse Fur?

25:50.880 --> 25:52.000
That's very rare,

25:52.440 --> 25:53.640
so it can't be a coincidence.

25:54.270 --> 25:55.680
I'll go find that scroll right away.

26:04.160 --> 26:04.920
Act within your limits.

26:05.000 --> 26:05.830
Don't force it.

26:06.200 --> 26:07.590
And especially, don't use yourself as a bargaining chip

26:07.720 --> 26:08.440
by agreeing to marry…

26:11.330 --> 26:12.410
Master, what are you saying?

26:12.440 --> 26:13.200
My spiritual power is unstable.

26:13.220 --> 26:13.980
I can't hear you.

26:14.070 --> 26:14.750
Xue Ranran!

26:16.200 --> 26:16.750
Master,

26:16.960 --> 26:18.830
I really can't hold on any longer.

26:22.400 --> 26:23.590
The Divine Tree's leaves are connected.

26:23.610 --> 26:24.610
They can act as a link between us.

26:24.750 --> 26:25.590
Wait for my good news.

26:26.000 --> 26:26.590
Be careful!

26:45.420 --> 26:46.690
This is the empty box

26:46.720 --> 26:47.440
where Master

26:47.440 --> 26:48.480
found "The Xuantian Teachings."

26:55.030 --> 26:55.680
It's here.

27:03.590 --> 27:05.110
As expected, nothing looks out of place.

27:06.000 --> 27:07.350
It's all just the Heavenly One's teachings

27:07.440 --> 27:09.510
on spiritual training and cultivation.

27:13.110 --> 27:14.720
There must be some key

27:15.160 --> 27:16.350
to reveal the true content

27:16.370 --> 27:17.650
of both scrolls.

27:32.310 --> 27:33.830
I knew it!

27:40.350 --> 27:41.200
Oh no.

27:41.440 --> 27:42.960
The wooden puppet doesn't have enough power

27:43.270 --> 27:44.070
to shrink it.

27:46.790 --> 27:49.070
The method to return the spiritual soul…

28:00.770 --> 28:01.610
I knew I heard

28:01.640 --> 28:02.750
something drop.

28:23.480 --> 28:24.070
Master.

28:29.000 --> 28:30.480
Can you hear me?

28:35.790 --> 28:37.070
This method really worked.

28:37.480 --> 28:38.200
Master,

28:38.920 --> 28:39.640
my primordial spirit

28:39.640 --> 28:41.000
has returned to my body.

28:41.110 --> 28:41.790
Don't worry.

28:42.830 --> 28:43.510
That's good.

28:44.400 --> 28:45.240
I found the other half

28:45.270 --> 28:46.070
of "The Xuantian Teachings."

28:46.790 --> 28:48.550
Our guess was right.

28:49.200 --> 28:49.960
Unfortunately,

28:50.400 --> 28:51.830
the wooden puppet couldn't bring it back.

28:52.400 --> 28:53.720
I'll find another way.

28:54.270 --> 28:54.830
And also…

28:55.680 --> 28:56.270
Forget it.

28:56.720 --> 28:58.110
I'd better not tell Master yet

28:58.480 --> 28:59.240
that I've found

28:59.240 --> 29:00.310
the method to return the spiritual soul.

29:01.000 --> 29:02.550
Otherwise, he'd never agree to it.

29:03.070 --> 29:03.880
Master,

29:05.240 --> 29:06.530
I'll definitely save you.

29:08.680 --> 29:09.510
No matter what,

29:09.720 --> 29:10.720
don't do anything reckless.

29:12.070 --> 29:12.790
Got it.

29:30.840 --> 29:31.930
How should I tell Su Yu

29:31.960 --> 29:33.160
I've changed my mind and decided to marry him

29:33.550 --> 29:34.790
in a natural way?

29:53.160 --> 29:53.790
What?

29:55.070 --> 29:55.920
You don't like

29:55.920 --> 29:57.240
any of the things

29:58.240 --> 29:59.110
I sent over yesterday?

29:59.510 --> 30:00.920
Maybe I should soften my attitude a bit

30:01.270 --> 30:02.920
and say I like some of them.

30:04.310 --> 30:05.070
No,

30:05.240 --> 30:06.110
that would sound too forced.

30:16.590 --> 30:17.750
I think this hairpin

30:18.110 --> 30:19.150
suits you well.

30:39.750 --> 30:40.400
By the way,

30:41.510 --> 30:42.790
after the court meeting this morning,

30:43.000 --> 30:44.590
I sent someone to Xue Village.

30:45.310 --> 30:46.240
You once said

30:47.270 --> 30:48.160
that the people of Xue Village

30:48.160 --> 30:49.750
offered you food as you grew up.

30:50.510 --> 30:52.160
Our wedding is a grand event,

30:52.750 --> 30:54.430
so naturally, they must be invited.

30:55.960 --> 30:57.440
What are you going to do to them?

30:58.160 --> 30:59.000
Don't worry.

30:59.880 --> 31:01.440
As long as you agree to marry me,

31:01.890 --> 31:02.510
they

31:03.200 --> 31:04.720
will be honored guests of the Crown Princess.

31:05.440 --> 31:06.920
No one would dare to harm them.

31:08.510 --> 31:10.030
You're using them to threaten me?

31:11.240 --> 31:12.030
Ranran,

31:13.110 --> 31:14.550
I just want you to understand

31:15.160 --> 31:16.350
how serious I am about you.

31:18.070 --> 31:19.440
How about this?

31:19.830 --> 31:21.000
I'll have them brought in

31:21.590 --> 31:22.590
one by one,

31:22.590 --> 31:23.590
asking you

31:24.510 --> 31:25.720
if you've made your decision

31:26.400 --> 31:27.070
to wear

31:27.070 --> 31:28.480
the wedding dress I've prepared for you.

31:30.160 --> 31:30.830
Let's see

31:30.830 --> 31:32.110
how many of them are left

31:33.030 --> 31:33.920
by the time

31:34.270 --> 31:35.510
I hear the answer I want.

31:36.480 --> 31:37.640
Don't hurt them!

31:39.270 --> 31:39.960
Fine.

31:41.000 --> 31:41.750
I agree.

31:42.590 --> 31:43.640
I'll marry you.

31:44.030 --> 31:45.030
Let them go.

31:47.590 --> 31:48.790
Y-You finally agreed.

31:49.110 --> 31:50.270
You're finally willing to marry me!

31:55.510 --> 31:57.070
Do I have any other choice?

31:59.590 --> 32:00.920
But if you really want to marry me,

32:02.310 --> 32:03.590
hold the wedding in four days.

32:04.310 --> 32:05.310
In four days?

32:06.590 --> 32:07.270
The Double Ninth Festival?

32:08.200 --> 32:09.510
Since I was little, I've always dreamed that

32:10.070 --> 32:11.270
on the Double Ninth Festival,

32:11.590 --> 32:12.680
I'd wear a red wedding dress

32:13.330 --> 32:14.370
and soar through the sky

32:14.400 --> 32:15.510
with the one I love.

32:16.640 --> 32:17.590
I've been thinking

32:18.370 --> 32:19.130
maybe that is

32:19.160 --> 32:20.640
fate's plan for me.

32:21.770 --> 32:22.530
That's why

32:23.240 --> 32:24.720
getting married on the Double Ninth Festival

32:25.590 --> 32:26.960
has always been my wish.

32:30.510 --> 32:31.400
As long as it makes you happy,

32:32.030 --> 32:32.920
any day will do.

32:33.920 --> 32:34.440
Also,

32:35.510 --> 32:36.750
if you truly love me,

32:37.750 --> 32:38.880
marry me as Su Yu, the Crown Prince,

32:38.880 --> 32:40.270
with your real face.

32:41.000 --> 32:42.590
The groom has to be you.

32:43.400 --> 32:44.030
Alright.

32:45.750 --> 32:46.670
Whatever you want,

32:47.920 --> 32:48.830
I'll give it to you.

32:50.240 --> 32:50.880
Really?

32:54.110 --> 32:55.240
Then I have one more request.

32:56.730 --> 32:57.970
Before a bride gets married,

32:58.000 --> 32:59.160
she's usually accompanied by her family.

32:59.790 --> 33:01.720
I want my seniors from Wester Sect

33:01.900 --> 33:02.860
to accompany me in the palace.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.830
Don't the Heavenly Ones avoid involvement in court affairs?

33:09.920 --> 33:11.440
It may not be proper

33:13.220 --> 33:15.020
for them to enter the palace.

33:18.510 --> 33:19.200
How about this?

33:20.110 --> 33:21.000
You used to be

33:21.030 --> 33:22.270
very close to Feihua.

33:23.030 --> 33:24.240
I'll have her accompany you.

33:27.400 --> 33:28.160
Alright then.

33:29.930 --> 33:30.890
I'll send someone

33:30.920 --> 33:31.790
to bring her over now.

33:41.750 --> 33:42.350
Your Highness,

33:42.960 --> 33:44.680
do you really want Concubine Zhou to come over?

33:45.030 --> 33:45.750
It's fine.

33:46.040 --> 33:47.280
Feihua is not able

33:47.310 --> 33:48.590
to cause much trouble anyway.

33:48.880 --> 33:49.350
Do it.

33:49.550 --> 33:50.070
Yes.

33:53.880 --> 33:54.440
Qingge.

33:55.030 --> 33:55.830
Feihua.

33:58.110 --> 33:59.590
You're the real Qingge.

34:01.440 --> 34:02.110
It's just that

34:02.400 --> 34:03.400
I still don't remember

34:03.420 --> 34:04.730
everything about the past.

34:11.510 --> 34:12.190
Has Su Yu

34:12.510 --> 34:14.110
done anything to you these past few days?

34:15.590 --> 34:16.750
He only put me under house arrest,

34:16.840 --> 34:17.920
nothing more.

34:19.000 --> 34:20.320
But I never thought

34:20.550 --> 34:21.440
he'd become

34:21.440 --> 34:22.530
like this.

34:23.550 --> 34:24.360
All these years,

34:24.920 --> 34:26.150
he'd been waiting for you,

34:26.840 --> 34:27.920
and it had driven him mad.

34:28.880 --> 34:30.110
But when you met again,

34:31.110 --> 34:32.280
everything had changed.

34:34.230 --> 34:35.070
We can't let him

34:35.070 --> 34:36.320
make more mistakes.

34:36.590 --> 34:37.320
Feihua,

34:37.340 --> 34:38.030
actually, I…

34:42.110 --> 34:43.840
I need your help with something.

34:49.840 --> 34:50.320
Alright.

34:50.760 --> 34:51.360
I'll try.

35:00.760 --> 35:01.400
Don't worry.

35:01.590 --> 35:02.760
No one around

35:02.760 --> 35:03.550
can hear us.

35:05.510 --> 35:06.550
It's roughly like this.

35:07.880 --> 35:09.030
Li aligns with Kun.

35:09.270 --> 35:10.540
Xun splits left and right.

35:13.320 --> 35:14.760
Heaven and Gen merge as one.

35:15.000 --> 35:16.440
The weakest point of the formation

35:16.670 --> 35:17.760
should be around here.

35:18.590 --> 35:19.880
Have you found a way

35:20.000 --> 35:21.280
to break the Eastern Palace's formation?

35:21.760 --> 35:22.510
Not yet.

35:23.280 --> 35:25.070
To break the formation, I must locate its core exactly.

35:25.510 --> 35:26.760
And I'll need some help,

35:27.280 --> 35:28.800
but I can't get out now.

35:32.670 --> 35:33.510
Mu Ranwu,

35:34.110 --> 35:35.400
perhaps she can help me.

35:35.920 --> 35:36.800
Come to think of it,

35:37.280 --> 35:38.840
the binding talisman I put on her

35:39.230 --> 35:40.440
should be wearing off soon.

35:42.150 --> 35:43.000
I understand.

35:46.150 --> 35:46.960
But…

35:48.280 --> 35:49.230
what about His Highness?

35:50.510 --> 35:51.710
What will happen to him?

35:54.630 --> 35:55.400
I don't know.

35:56.360 --> 35:57.510
But his body

35:57.800 --> 35:59.230
is indeed running on fumes.

36:00.190 --> 36:01.590
I doubt he can hold on much longer.

36:05.230 --> 36:06.190
No matter what,

36:06.670 --> 36:07.510
I can't let him

36:07.510 --> 36:08.630
make more mistakes

36:09.000 --> 36:10.320
that hurt both himself and others.

36:13.480 --> 36:14.550
I'll be going then.

36:14.920 --> 36:15.670
Feihua,

36:16.150 --> 36:17.230
be careful.

36:51.370 --> 36:52.650
Forgive me, Your Highness.

36:53.150 --> 36:54.510
What's the celebration about?

36:55.070 --> 36:57.110
The Crown Prince and Princess are getting married.

36:58.110 --> 36:58.840
The Crown Princess?

37:00.630 --> 37:01.550
Watch your words!

37:03.360 --> 37:04.150
Leave at once.

37:04.550 --> 37:05.510
Yes.

37:08.400 --> 37:09.800
The Crown Prince is getting married?

37:10.030 --> 37:10.960
Why do I know nothing about this?

37:11.670 --> 37:12.400
Qingge,

37:12.510 --> 37:13.670
don't believe them.

37:13.940 --> 37:15.250
The Crown Prince must

37:15.280 --> 37:16.840
be under some talisman or spell.

37:17.070 --> 37:18.670
Otherwise, why would he recklessly

37:18.810 --> 37:19.560
insist on marrying

37:19.590 --> 37:21.110
a girl who intruded into the palace?

37:22.440 --> 37:23.630
You mean Xue Ranran?

37:26.000 --> 37:26.880
Apologies, Madam Battle,

37:27.090 --> 37:28.210
but without the Crown Prince's permission,

37:28.400 --> 37:29.150
you may not enter.

37:30.030 --> 37:31.070
Let her in.

37:31.400 --> 37:32.400
I want to see her.

37:32.750 --> 37:33.510
Open the door!

37:33.760 --> 37:34.320
Yes.

37:33.840 --> 37:36.880
[Cool Breeze Palace]

37:37.550 --> 37:39.400
How dare you enter the palace using my identity?

37:39.840 --> 37:40.150
You...

37:40.190 --> 37:40.920
Doesn't your identity

37:40.940 --> 37:42.260
belong to me?

37:43.760 --> 37:44.840
So you already know

37:45.880 --> 37:47.030
who you really are.

37:47.510 --> 37:48.280
Are you scared now?

37:50.150 --> 37:51.280
You brazenly

37:51.280 --> 37:52.400
took my identity,

37:52.890 --> 37:53.680
but did you never think

37:53.710 --> 37:55.400
there would come a day when you'd be exposed?

37:58.320 --> 38:00.320
Su Yu has also found out?

38:02.840 --> 38:04.360
I can barely remember it.

38:04.780 --> 38:06.530
But I'd like to hear it from you.

38:07.030 --> 38:08.800
I was your elder sister in the previous life.

38:09.030 --> 38:10.800
What did I do to you

38:11.520 --> 38:12.200
to make you

38:12.230 --> 38:13.510
kill me in my previous life?

38:13.960 --> 38:15.070
After we were reborn,

38:15.800 --> 38:16.960
you stole my Spirit Roots,

38:17.480 --> 38:19.480
used my identity to deceive and harm others,

38:20.000 --> 38:21.760
and even wanted to kill me again.

38:23.030 --> 38:23.630
Why?

38:28.590 --> 38:29.760
You're asking me why?

38:31.150 --> 38:33.360
Whether in the past or now,

38:33.840 --> 38:35.360
everyone around me,

38:35.680 --> 38:36.560
without exception,

38:36.590 --> 38:38.550
has always spoken of Mu Qingge with admiration.

38:39.190 --> 38:40.320
You were flawless

38:41.030 --> 38:42.030
as a mentor

38:42.920 --> 38:44.840
and as a friend.

38:46.190 --> 38:48.320
But how did you treat me?

38:50.630 --> 38:51.670
You tell me.

38:52.360 --> 38:53.030
You knew full well

38:53.030 --> 38:54.320
I had no talent for cultivation,

38:54.670 --> 38:55.510
that my foundation was so weak

38:55.510 --> 38:56.880
it wasn't even worth mentioning.

38:57.670 --> 38:59.110
Yet you still

38:59.320 --> 39:00.840
dragged me into the cultivation world,

39:01.630 --> 39:04.190
forcing me into a life of endless comparisons,

39:04.550 --> 39:05.510
mockery,

39:05.880 --> 39:07.230
and humiliation.

39:08.190 --> 39:09.030
Do you know

39:10.590 --> 39:12.110
how much that crushed me

39:14.030 --> 39:16.360
and made me wish I were dead?

39:16.920 --> 39:17.710
But

39:18.480 --> 39:20.670
why was I so mediocre?

39:22.150 --> 39:23.960
It was all because of you,

39:25.320 --> 39:26.550
my dear sister.

39:27.150 --> 39:27.630
Me?

39:29.000 --> 39:30.760
That year, when we traveled with our family,

39:31.590 --> 39:32.840
we encountered bandits in the mountains.

39:33.480 --> 39:35.510
Father died protecting you.

39:36.400 --> 39:38.480
If you hadn't caused Father's death...

39:39.360 --> 39:40.440
If you hadn't

39:40.510 --> 39:41.880
only cared about others

39:42.070 --> 39:44.110
and ignored your own starving,

39:44.130 --> 39:45.570
freezing little sister,

39:46.880 --> 39:48.280
I wouldn't have ended up

39:48.920 --> 39:50.190
with a damaged foundation,

39:51.000 --> 39:52.320
which made immortality impossible for me.

40:02.710 --> 40:04.630
Uncle Ye Xin always praised you,

40:06.480 --> 40:08.360
calling you a prodigy,

40:09.480 --> 40:10.670
but he only told me

40:11.670 --> 40:13.190
that being ordinary was a blessing.

40:15.920 --> 40:18.110
Why was being ordinary my fate?

40:18.960 --> 40:20.030
Do you know

40:20.880 --> 40:21.920
how cruel

40:22.440 --> 40:24.280
your existence is to me?

40:25.720 --> 40:28.190
Do you have any idea how much I hate you?

40:29.000 --> 40:29.880
Why?

40:30.850 --> 40:32.850
Why can't I be you?

40:34.710 --> 40:36.670
But I died once because of you.

40:37.510 --> 40:38.360
Starting over again,

40:39.110 --> 40:40.840
you got the Spirit Roots and the talent.

40:41.070 --> 40:42.000
Isn't that enough?

40:42.760 --> 40:43.710
You say you hate me.

40:44.000 --> 40:45.190
I won't argue with that.

40:45.880 --> 40:47.280
But for your own benefit,

40:47.760 --> 40:49.000
you killed so many

40:49.000 --> 40:49.840
innocent people.

40:50.550 --> 40:51.150
What kind of

40:51.150 --> 40:52.320
twisted reasoning is that?

40:53.110 --> 40:54.440
Don't lecture me!

40:55.280 --> 40:55.920
Right,

40:56.560 --> 40:57.960
what's the point of reasoning

40:58.070 --> 40:58.840
with someone so absurd?

40:59.670 --> 41:00.480
She was lured here

41:00.480 --> 41:01.440
just to stir up chaos.

41:02.370 --> 41:03.410
Honestly, I find you

41:03.440 --> 41:04.550
both pitiful and laughable.

41:05.320 --> 41:06.760
You tried so hard to impersonate me,

41:07.110 --> 41:07.880
but in the end,

41:07.880 --> 41:09.230
you're just a cheap imitation,

41:09.400 --> 41:10.550
a failed copy.

41:10.880 --> 41:11.190
You...

41:11.210 --> 41:11.890
What?

41:12.080 --> 41:12.930
Do you still think

41:12.960 --> 41:13.800
I'll indulge you

41:14.000 --> 41:15.370
like I did in my past life?

41:16.280 --> 41:17.720
Do you still expect me to care about

41:17.740 --> 41:19.610
the family bond you personally destroyed?

41:20.630 --> 41:22.280
Mu Ranwu, you're a joke.

41:23.110 --> 41:24.800
You said you wish I didn't exist,

41:25.360 --> 41:26.190
yet you cling to my old name

41:26.190 --> 41:27.400
to build your life.

41:27.970 --> 41:29.200
Can't you rely on yourself

41:29.230 --> 41:29.960
to live on?

41:30.880 --> 41:31.550
Unfortunately,

41:31.920 --> 41:33.320
a fake will always be a fake.

41:34.850 --> 41:36.370
Su Yu has only ever

41:36.400 --> 41:38.030
wanted to marry me.

41:39.070 --> 41:40.320
Now that I'm back,

41:40.800 --> 41:41.230
you

41:41.630 --> 41:42.510
are finished.

41:46.010 --> 41:46.680
Are you crazy?

41:47.720 --> 41:49.080
Su Yu won't let you off when he returns.

41:49.110 --> 41:50.440
Then I'll kill you first!

41:51.840 --> 41:52.400
Madam Battle,

41:52.710 --> 41:54.070
she's the Crown Prince's honored guest.

41:54.090 --> 41:54.700
You can't hurt her.

41:55.010 --> 41:56.900
You think you can stop me?

42:08.400 --> 42:09.000
Any formation

42:09.000 --> 42:10.070
has its weak point.

42:18.590 --> 42:20.320
I can use a bit of spiritual power here.

42:20.920 --> 42:22.230
This must be the weakest spot

42:22.440 --> 42:23.480
of the palace's defensive formation.

42:27.360 --> 42:27.960
Ranran.

42:28.710 --> 42:30.000
From this weak spot,

42:30.960 --> 42:32.030
anywhere my power

42:32.030 --> 42:33.000
can reach

42:33.360 --> 42:34.480
indicates an opening.

42:51.760 --> 42:53.440
Do you think you can escape?

42:54.360 --> 42:54.920
Bai,

42:54.960 --> 42:55.800
I'm counting on you.

43:15.190 --> 43:15.960
Master.
